Detect the mental activity of creatures in a radius of [12, 13, 13, 14, 15 (TL1-5; WIL 100; MP 100)] for [6, 8, 9, 10, 12 (TL1-5)] turns.

This reveals their location and boosts your defense by [22, 30, 36, 41, 46 (TL1-5; WIL 100; MP 100)].

The defense scales with you Mindpower and the range with your Willpower.
